1
00:00:07,816 --> 00:00:13,538
What is valid, what is missing, and what
is about to run out — for everybody at

2
00:00:13,538 --> 00:00:13,900
once.

3
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:19,742
The date comes off the document, not
off whoever filed it at four on a Friday.

4
00:00:20,194 --> 00:00:24,281
So what is short is
visible before it is urgent.

5
00:00:24,732 --> 00:00:29,701
Chasing it is a list rather than a
conversation somebody has to remember to start.

6
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:35,588
And when somebody asks whether it was
valid that day, the answer is on file.

